    "summary": "New session-file-store.ts: the SessionFilesFs seam with its node implementation, and createFileChatSessionStore keeping each session as a head file and an append-only rows file. A save appends the rows the session object has not yet written and replaces the head through a temporary file and a rename; get reads once and hands back the same object while the files are unchanged; list reads heads only. The tests run over a new in-memory fake that records every file call. The rules for several windows, whole-file writes, failing writes and the session cap are task 3 and are not in this commit.",
